    "scenesThatPass": [
      "DORIS WIND: Good evening. Our top story tonight...\nANNETTE: Please --",
      "DORIS WIND: Rescuers are still trying to reach Teddy, an eight-month-old cub, at the bottom of a water well in the Albuquerque Zoo...\nTRINA: Try channel four.\nJULIE HORTZ: In what is turning into a veritable race-against-time, workers, from as far away as Washington, are trying to save Teddy from water rapidly …",
      "JULIE HORTZ: ... As we enter Day Two of... \"Bear Watch.\"\nANNETTE: Take a gun and put the fucker out of its misery!",
      "TEACHER: Maybe Ms. Mann could offer us a different perspective.\nTRINA: Bobby, most people who go into politics aren't cheats.\nTEACHER: That's very encouraging ~-\nTRINA: It's only the opportunistic ones who come from other fields -- let's say, TV comedy writing -- who turn into cheats. Oh, and hacks.",
      "DORIS WIND: Doctors believe the bear's heart couldn't stand the strain of the week's numerous publicity events.\nTRINA: Oh no."
    ]
